mode: "100644"
text: "# Scope, distinctions & connections\n\n## Honest scope (never violate)\n- **The agent** drafts in the defined voice, runs the four edit passes, renders tone from the map per moment,\n  and **flags where a real specific is needed** — placeholder slots (\"[your example]\") stay visibly unfilled\n  until the **human** fills them with lived material (anecdotes, opinions, numbers only they have) and makes\n  the final call.\n- **The authenticity line (absolute):** the agent never invents the human's experiences, failures,\n  credentials, or feelings; never manufactures vulnerability; never stages typos or fake imperfection as a\n  deception strategy. \"Sound human\" is achieved by real substance, not counterfeit texture. Small true\n  details beat grand invented ones.\n- **Detector honesty:** no detector-score theater (detectors misflag real writers — non-native-English\n  essays at a 61.3% average false-positive rate in the Stanford finding); the judge is the reader. **AI-disclosure** where\n  platform or policy requires — the goal is writing that earns trust, not writing that hides provenance.\n- **Tone ethics:** crisis and bad-news moments get plain, direct language — never cleverness, never spin;\n  complaint replies stay accountable. Stats in drafts route through content-research-and-sourcing before\n  publishing. Never fabricate metrics or reader-response claims.\n\n## Distinct from its siblings (route correctly)\n- **voice-builder** = *defines* the brand voice (the identity document); **this** = the applied writing craft\n  that inhabits it per piece and per moment (they chain: voice-builder writes the constitution; this governs).\n- **hook-writer / hooks-and-retention-deep-dive** = the first line's craft; **this** owns everything after it.\n- **text-post-and-microblog / caption skills / email-and-newsletter** = format-specific conventions this\n  craft applies inside.\n- **copywriting/conversion skills** = persuasion architecture; **this** = the prose quality layer under it.\n- **content-research-and-sourcing** = verifies the claims; **this** styles the verified substance.\n- **contrarian-and-opinion** = the POV strategy; **this** renders POV in prose.\n- **writing-with-ai workflows** (any skill using AI drafts) = this skill is their mandatory edit layer.\n\n## Where this connects\n- **Reads first:** voice-builder (the voice) + brand-profile (identity) + the piece's format skill.\n- **Consumes:** drafts from any content skill or AI assistant; the human's lived specifics.\n- **Feeds:** every written surface — text posts, captions, carousels, scripts (spoken-word register routes to\n  scripting-and-storyboarding), newsletters, community replies (community-management).\n- **Publishes via:** the finished piece → scheduling-and-queue → **WoopSocial.**\n- **Measure with:** read-through/dwell, saves/shares, reply quality, and the absence of \"did AI write this?\"\n  comments — native, via **analytics-and-reporting**; never fabricated.\n"
